# SHA-256 for every raw capture in this repository.
# Generated from the ORIGINAL acquisition files; each was verified against its
# source at publication time.
# Verify with:  sha256sum -c data/stock/hashes.sha256   (run from repo root)
#
# CH7 PROVENANCE NOTE:
# The floppy captures' embedded acquisition metadata labels CH7 as "PMCYC".
# That label is WRONG. CH7 was physically clipped to DACK (SCSI DMA
# acknowledge). PMCYC was NOT captured at all.
# These originals are published UNMODIFIED, wrong label included -- that label
# is evidence of what the acquisition software was told. The correction is
# applied at analysis time:
#     python3 scripts/sr_to_arrays.py CAPTURE.sr OUTDIR --rename PMCYC=DACK
#
# The 16:17:47 SCSI capture's CH7 physical identity is AMBIGUOUS (live signal,
# consistent with either net). It is not claimed here. See docs/probe-map.md.
